Output multiple_groups.gif

Set Height 800
Set Width 1000

Hide
	Type "go build -o program ." Enter
	Type "clear && ./program" Enter
	Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 2s

Up@500ms 2
Sleep 1s

Enter
Sleep 2s

Up@500ms 2
Sleep 1s
Space
Sleep 1s

Enter
Sleep 2s
Up@500ms 4
Sleep 1s

Shift+Tab
Sleep 1s

Shift+Tab
Sleep 1s

Enter@1s 3

Sleep 2s

Hide
Type "rm program" Enter
Sleep 1s
	
